The learner under audit
This is the accepted Lecture 9 one-dimensional logistic witness: the horizontal axis is the public feature, the vertical axis is the predicted probability, and colors show the true label. A target is interesting to an auditor only if inserting or removing it shifts a score computed from the trained model.


